{"info": {"author": "Ethereum Foundation", "author_email": "security@ethereum.org", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": [], "description": "# Python Bindings for the C-KZG Library\n\nThis directory contains Python bindings for the C-KZG-4844 library.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nThese bindings require `python3`, `PyYAML` and `make`.\n```\nsudo apt install python3 python3-pip\npython3 -m pip install build PyYAML\n```\n\n## Build & test\n\nEverything is consolidated into one command:\n```\nmake\n```\n\nYou should expect to see these messages at the bottom:\n```\npython3 tests.py\ntests passed\n```\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["Author", "Author-Email", "Description", "Description-Content-Type", "Home-Page", "License", "License-File", "Summary"], "home_page": "https://github.com/ethereum/c-kzg-4844", "keywords": null, "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "ckzg", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/ckzg/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/ckzg/", "project_urls": {"Homepage": "https://github.com/ethereum/c-kzg-4844"}, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/ckzg/2.1.8/", "requires_dist": null, "requires_python": null, "summary": "Python bindings for C-KZG-4844", "version": "2.1.8", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"0.4.2": "2024-02-22T03:17:51.818888Z", "0.4.3": "2024-03-04T20:30:27.875179Z", "1.0.0": "2024-03-12T14:17:36.298171Z", "1.0.1": "2024-04-17T01:23:23.691925Z", "1.0.2": "2024-05-07T20:49:09.369982Z", "2.0.0": "2024-08-20T13:38:19.563024Z", "2.0.1": "2024-09-03T13:51:05.471629Z", "2.1.0": "2025-03-13T19:49:03.615655Z", "2.1.1": "2025-03-31T21:22:26.952494Z", "2.1.2": "2025-09-04T10:54:55.770947Z", "2.1.3": "2025-09-16T20:23:23.743980Z", "2.1.4": "2025-09